column41:
You can do it in jQuery very easily.  Give your password field the id of "hover-password" and add the following jQuery snippet:<p><pre><code>  $(function() {
    $("#hover-password").hover(
      function() {
        this.type = "text";
      },
      function() {
        this.type = "password";
      }
    );
  });</code></pre>
